# Roblox Brain corpus — 34MB / 5,464 files of *derived* output. It is rebuilt
# deterministically from the pinned commits in source-lock.json by
# scripts/roblox-brain/normalize-corpus.mjs, so the provenance (source-lock,
# ingestion-manifest, coverage report and step reports) is versioned and the
# bulk is not.
docs/roblox-brain/corpus/

